This repository does not contain data files. The plugin shows data from the
gunsnprices gem (https://rubygems.org/gems/gunsnprices): the caliber list
(calibers.json) and the model dictionaries (models.json) in the gem's data/
directory. Caliber names, model names and the caliber page links in the
plugin's output come from these files.

